+           row  `Parse`  1  _the message could not be parsed as JSON_  code de transmission −32700
+           row  `InvalidRequest`  2  _the message was not a valid JSON-RPC request_  code de transmission −32600
+           row  `MethodNotFound`  3  _the method name was not recognised_  code de transmission −32601
+           row  `InvalidParams`  4  _the parameters were not valid for the requested method_  code de transmission −32602
+           row  `Internal`  5  _an internal error occurred_  code de transmission −32603
+           row  `AuthRequired`  6  _the agent requires authentication_  code de transmission −32000
+           row  `Incompatible`  7  _the agent does not support the protocol version this client implements_  pas de code de transmission

